<!-- ======== FAQ ======== -->
  <section id="faq" class="sec bg-slate-50" data-section="faq">
  <div class="container-narrow">
  {{ sectionHeader('FAQ', 'Car Charger <span class="text-brandOrange">FAQ</span>', 'Compatibility & Safety Insights', {max: ''}) }}
  <div class="reveal">
  {% call faqItem("Does your car charger support 45W for Samsung S24 Ultra?", true) %}Yes. Our car chargers support PPS (Programmable Power Supply), providing the full 45W 'Super Fast Charging 2.0' required for Samsung flagship devices including Galaxy S24 Ultra, S23, and Note series.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Can these be used in 24V trucks as well as 12V cars?", true) %}Absolutely. Our internal DC-DC buck-boost converters are designed for a wide input range of <strong>12V-24V</strong>, making them suitable for everything from family sedans to commercial trucks and heavy-duty vehicles.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Do your car chargers support PD 3.1 for laptop charging?", true) %}Yes. Our flagship models support PD 3.1 with up to <strong>140W output</strong>, compatible with MacBook Pro, Dell XPS, ThinkPad, and other USB-C laptops. The WOC24 140W model features dual PD ports delivering 65W + 30W simultaneously.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Will high-power charging (100W) overheat the device?") %}No. Our GaN-powered car adapters handle up to 140W output while maintaining a cool exterior. We use advanced thermal management with multiple air vents, intelligent thermal throttling, and premium materials like aluminum alloy or V0 fire-retardant PC shells.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("What safety certifications do your car chargers have?") %}All models are fully compliant with <strong>E-Mark, CE, FCC, and RoHS</strong> for global automotive markets. We also conduct 24-hour salt spray testing for anti-corrosion and 3000+ plug/unplug cycle tests to ensure long-term durability.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Do mini hidden car chargers fit all vehicle types?") %}Yes. Our WOC05 mini hidden charger features a pull ring design for easy removal and fits standard 12V-24V cigarette lighter sockets in all passenger vehicles, trucks, and SUVs.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Can WOC04 support Qi2.2 wireless chargers?") %}Yes. The WOC04 mini PD 45W charger supports Qi2.2 15V output, compatible with Qi2-certified wireless charging pads and devices requiring 15V-20V high-power charging.{% endcall %}
  </div>
 </div>
 </section>

